{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Minpick 是一款協助你在零碎時間內快速決定要做甚麼的待辦工具，適合經常面對長清單、卻在開始前花太多時間猶豫的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-1.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>依剩餘時間篩選任務</h2>\n<p>你可先記錄想做的工作及大約所需分鐘，當只剩下 3、5 或 10 分鐘時，直接按時間挑選，Minpick 會顯示最多三項應該適合的任務，免卻再次掃視長清單。需要收窄範圍時，可依分類或優先程度篩選；亦可從主畫面小工具選擇時間，並設定指定日子與時間的提醒。應用支援切換語言、VoiceOver 與動態字體。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Minpick</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/minpick/id6781131521?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.408042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":288,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T18:30:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.509850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.509850+00:00","content_hash":"fd1cf44d34e21c506eb700673aae8f3e446ff07cea9f0ec774845ea421c2dee6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}